Ship 2026

Registration is open for Ship, June 24 in New York and streamed online. Product keynotes, deep-dive sessions on Next.js and the AI SDK, and a hallway track that people tell us is the best part.

In-person: $199 early bird through April 30. Online: free.

Register: https://vercel.com/ship?ref=nl-0320

Pro plan offer
Teams moving from Hobby to Pro before April 15 get two months free on an annual plan. Pro includes team collaboration, preview deployments with comments, and 1TB of bandwidth.

Also this month: Vercel Agent is generally available, and Fluid compute is now the default for all new projects.

